WEBVTT

00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:05.500
NARRATOR: You can't be there every time Mom's phone rings.

00:00:06.510 --> 00:00:15.240
NARRATOR: So when a number she doesn't know calls, an assistant answers first. Her phone stays quiet.

00:00:15.920 --> 00:00:22.270
ASSISTANT: Hi, this is Ruth's call assistant. I can pass you through or take a message. May I ask who's calling?

00:00:22.490 --> 00:00:27.040
DANA, OAK STREET PHARMACY: Hi, it's Dana from Oak Street Pharmacy. Her prescription is ready.

00:00:27.260 --> 00:00:30.300
ASSISTANT: Thanks, Dana. One moment, I'll put you through.

00:00:33.650 --> 00:00:37.290
CALLER: This is Medicare benefits. I need to confirm her card number today.

00:00:37.510 --> 00:00:41.590
ASSISTANT: I'm not able to help with that. I'm ending this call. Goodbye.

00:00:42.510 --> 00:00:46.640
NARRATOR: A scam call ends there. Mom never hears it.

00:00:47.620 --> 00:00:51.270
SAM, NEXT DOOR: It's Sam from next door, just checking in.

00:00:51.490 --> 00:00:54.710
ASSISTANT: Ruth can't take the call right now. I'll pass that on.

00:00:58.350 --> 00:01:01.420
NARRATOR: And you get a note, every time.
